{"id":"n29737-1-10","stage":0,"title":"이번 · 这次","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n29737-1-10-1","ko":"시험이 얼마나 남았지요?","zh":"考试还有多久呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"시험이","meaning":"考试","explanation":"시험：考试；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"시험","audio":"/audio/ff65dc582ce71198934b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20233","senseId":"1","lemma":"시험","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"얼마나","meaning":"多少","explanation":"얼마：多少；나：表示不止预期的数量、举例或退而求其次等，需结合整句语气。","readings":[{"term":"얼마","audio":"/audio/8e0a4529e0c9d4ed9058.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29750","senseId":"1","lemma":"얼마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"남았지요?","meaning":"剩，剩下","explanation":"남다：剩，剩下；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；지요：礼貌地确认、提醒或表达意愿；죠 是 지요 的缩略。","readings":[{"term":"남다","audio":"/audio/10946131f919fe8058dd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64552","senseId":"1","lemma":"남다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"ff65dc582ce71198","term":"시험","zh":"考试","audio":"/audio/ff65dc582ce71198934b.mp3","entryId":"20233","definition":"按照问题、提问、实际行动等一定程序考核考生的知识或能力的事宜。","pronunciation":["시험"]},{"id":"8e0a4529e0c9d4ed","term":"얼마","zh":"多少","audio":"/audio/8e0a4529e0c9d4ed9058.mp3","entryId":"29750","definition":"不知道的数量、价值、程度。","pronunciation":["얼마"]},{"id":"10946131f919fe80","term":"남다","zh":"剩，剩下","audio":"/audio/10946131f919fe8058dd.mp3","entryId":"64552","definition":"没用完，留下了一部分。","pronunciation":["남ː따"]}],"audio":"/audio/c1dbc310e6294dfd10dd.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n29737-1-10-2","ko":"이번 주 금요일이니까 삼 일 남았네요.","zh":"因为是这周的周五，所以还剩三天啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이번","meaning":"这次，这回","explanation":"이번：这次，这回","readings":[{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29737","senseId":"1","lemma":"이번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"주","meaning":"周，星期","explanation":"주：周，星期","readings":[{"term":"주","audio":"/audio/6234d5b178a8b25809d8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"46811","senseId":"1","lemma":"주","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"금요일이니까","meaning":"星期五，周五，礼拜五","explanation":"금요일：星期五，周五，礼拜五；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；니까：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"금요일","audio":"/audio/a594e9b583050ec46ff9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17289","senseId":"1","lemma":"금요일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"삼","meaning":"三","explanation":"삼：三","readings":[{"term":"삼","audio":"/audio/3cd6c40aac5fd42ef96d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61854","senseId":"1","lemma":"삼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"일","meaning":"一","explanation":"일：一","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31523","senseId":"1","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"남았네요.","meaning":"剩，剩下","explanation":"남다：剩，剩下；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"남다","audio":"/audio/10946131f919fe8058dd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64552","senseId":"1","lemma":"남다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"da78d4146f0588e8","term":"이번","zh":"这次，这回","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3","entryId":"29737","definition":"马上到来的顺序；或指刚过去的顺序。","pronunciation":["이번"]},{"id":"6234d5b178a8b258","term":"주","zh":"周，星期","audio":"/audio/6234d5b178a8b25809d8.mp3","entryId":"46811","definition":"从周一至周日七天为一周期计算的时间单位。","pronunciation":["주"]},{"id":"a594e9b583050ec4","term":"금요일","zh":"星期五，周五，礼拜五","audio":"/audio/a594e9b583050ec46ff9.mp3","entryId":"17289","definition":"以星期一为基准，指一个星期中的第五天。","pronunciation":["그묘일"]},{"id":"3cd6c40aac5fd42e","term":"삼","zh":"三","audio":"/audio/3cd6c40aac5fd42ef96d.mp3","entryId":"61854","definition":"二加一后所得的数目。","pronunciation":["삼"]},{"id":"dfc76879e2f5c3ea","term":"일","zh":"一","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3","entryId":"31523","definition":"数数时第一个数目。","pronunciation":["일"]},{"id":"10946131f919fe80","term":"남다","zh":"剩，剩下","audio":"/audio/10946131f919fe8058dd.mp3","entryId":"64552","definition":"没用完，留下了一部分。","pronunciation":["남ː따"]}],"audio":"/audio/c2f58d7c071cee4a7141.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.44,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=29737","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":9,"sequenceScore":0.201,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["考试还有多久呢？","因为是这周的周五，所以还剩三天啊。","这就是你考出来的分数？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["考试还有多久呢？","因为是这周的周五，所以还剩三天啊。","这就是你考出来的分数？"],"answer":1}]}
